            <h3 id='introduction'><span>Introduction</span></h3>
            <p><span>This is the website for our paper &quot;Learning from Rendering: Realistic and Controllable Extreme Rainy Image Synthesis for Autonomous Driving Simulation&quot;.</span></p>
